@*
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    _Imports.razor — Phase 15.5 (#291). The Razor imports every generated
    docs-sample component compiles against.

    Kept to @using lines only, per spec risk 2: a sample that needs more
    scaffolding than a using is fixed in the PAGE (the markdown fence)
    instead of here, so the prelude cannot grow into a second place a
    sample's real dependencies live.

    Components.Web is load-bearing for the same reason it is in every other
    _Imports.razor in this repo (see samples/BlazorNative.SampleApp's copy):
    without it, @bind/@onclick compile to literal markup with zero
    diagnostics.
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using BlazorNative.Components
@using BlazorNative.Core
@using BlazorNative.Device
@using BlazorNative.Runtime
